  "recommendation": "If Apple confirms that the charge will be coded as software, the Business Silver Rewards Card has the strongest stated rewards potential: approximately $10,000 back on $100,000. If the charge will be coded as entertainment or streaming, the Business Gold Rewards Card may provide approximately $2,500 if it qualifies as operations spending, versus approximately $1,000 otherwise. Do not assume the enhanced rate until the merchant category is confirmed.",
